// SRD 5.1 spell (docs/dnd.srd.5.1/07_Spells). Points default to the level; cantrips are free.
// Non-consumed SRD components are dropped (PRD §8.3); consumed ones go in `components`.
// `effect` is the shape of what the spell does; the numbers are rule slots in data/rules/casting.ron.
// Durations are party-clock minutes: a fight round is one minute, so the SRD's "1 minute" is 10.
// Deviation: one creature, not up to six (heals reach one target), and it is cast like any
// other spell rather than over ten minutes.
(schema: 1, id: "base:spell:prayer_of_healing", name: "base:text:spell.prayer_of_healing.name", level: 2, school: Evocation, classes: ["base:class:cleric"], concentration: false, ritual: false, description: "base:text:spell.prayer_of_healing.description", effect: Some(Heal(dice: (count: 2, sides: 8, modifier: 0), add_mod: true)), reach: One)
